  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation of the Danish Support to Civil Society</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The evaluation serves the dual purpose of accountability and learning. To this end, it will assess and document the results achieved by the Danish Civil Society Organisations (CSOs) through their partnerships with CSO&#x2019;s in the global south and stimulate joint learning in the MFA and its civil society partners</narrative>
  </description>
